In last few RAN2 meetings, the Rel-19 WI of Mobility enhancement was widely discussed and much progress has been made. Regarding inter-CU LTM, there are still some open issues on the details of inter-CU LTM in both non-DC and DC scenarios. In this contribution, we would like to share our opinions on the following remaining issues for inter-CU LTM.
Security key handling for inter-CU LTM in non-DC case;
Coexistence of one-shot LTM and subsequent LTM;
Inter-CU MCG LTM.
